      "content": "it's just not easy to take \"small steps\" when the situation feels so permanent. like, no matter what i do, i'm still just someone else having to pick up my slack. it feels less like a \"heavy weight\" and more like i'm just a constant, exhausting tax on their happiness. sometimes i wonder if everything would just be easier for them if i wasn't even an option anymore.",
